Subject: [PATCH] fix(ops): reproduce upstream WY equal-length indexing repair

Port the indexing repair from community PR #14333 to v0.26.0rc1. Keep packed behavior unchanged and add two-batch tail/chunk numerical regressions.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@localhost>
---
 .../triton/test_wy_source_regression.py       | 67 +++++++++++++++++++
 vllm_ascend/ops/triton/fla/wy_fast.py         | 11 +--
 2 files changed, 74 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
